{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MsTjwoihSoyQhVvfiz9KJx","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/trace-verdict-study/literature_map.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"categories:\\\\n  execution-trace-llm:\\\\n    description: \\\\\\\"Execution trace 辅助 LLM 代码理解/调试/推理\\\\\\\"\\\\n    papers:\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"NExT: Teaching Large Language Models to Reason about Code Execution\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Ansong Ni, Miltiadis Allamanis, et al. (Google DeepMind)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ICML 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: method-component\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"自训练在 execution trace 上做 CoT rationale，程序修复 fix rate 在 MBPP +26.1%、HumanEval +14.3%。模型可泛化到无 trace 的场景。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          mbpp_fix_rate_improvement: \\\\\\\"+26.1%\\\\\\\"\\\\n          humaneval_fix_rate_improvement: \\\\\\\"+14.3%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Do Code Semantics Help? A Comprehensive Study on Execution Trace-Based Information for Code LLMs\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Jian Wang, Xiaofei Xie, Qiang Hu, Shangqing Liu, Yi Li\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"Findings of EMNLP 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n        arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2509.11686\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: direct-competitor\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"综合研究发现 execution trace 对 SFT 和 test-time scaling 的帮助有限，与先前工作结论相左。提出 trace adapter 做格式化。这是 VOTA 必须回应的关键负面结果——说明原始 trace 不够，需要针对性压缩/抽象。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics: {}\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Code Execution as Grounded Supervision for LLM Reasoning\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Dongwon Jung, Wenxuan Zhou, Muhao Chen\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"EMNLP 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n        arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2506.10343\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: method-component\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"用 Python debugger (Snoop) 提取 step-by-step execution trace，转换为自然语言 CoT。训练后模型推理能力提升且生成更少 token（减少 overthinking），具备跨域迁移能力。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics: {}\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"What I cannot execute, I do not understand: Training and Evaluating LLMs on Program Execution Traces\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Lorenzo Ferrando, Nicola Ferraro, et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2503.05703\\\\\\\"\\\\n        arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2503.05703\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: method-component\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"对比 regular/compact/dynamic 三种 scratchpad 策略，compact（仅记录变化变量）略优于 regular（全部变量值）。CruxEval/MBPP ~80%。直接支持 plan_001：完整值信息冗余，精简不损失效果。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          cruxeval_accuracy: \\\\\\\"~80%\\\\\\\"\\\\n          mbpp_accuracy: \\\\\\\"~80%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Demystifying Errors in LLM Reasoning Traces: An Empirical Study of Code Execution Simulation\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Mohammad Abdollahi, Khandaker Rifah Tasnia, Soumit Kanti Saha, Jinqiu Yang, Song Wang, Hadi Hemmati\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv\\\\\\\"\\\\n        arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2512.00215\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: evaluation\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"LLM 在循环中频繁遗漏/多算变量修改，函数返回值预测不准。说明 LLM 对具体值追踪能力弱于结构理解，为 plan_001 发现（值冗余）提供机制解释。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics: {}\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Reasoning Runtime Behavior of a Program with LLM: How Far Are We? (REval)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Junkai Chen et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2403.16437\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: evaluation\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"REval 框架评估 LLM 在 4 种 runtime behavior 预测任务上的表现：coverage prediction、program state prediction、execution path prediction、output prediction。平均 accuracy 仅 44.4%，IC score 10.3。揭示 LLM runtime reasoning 能力有限，支持 VOTA 的发现——需要抽象而非让 LLM 直接消化全量 trace。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          avg_accuracy: \\\\\\\"44.4%\\\\\\\"\\\\n          avg_ic_score: \\\\\\\"10.3\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"CodeMind: Evaluating Large Language Models for Code Reasoning\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Changshu Liu et al. (UIUC)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2402.09664\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: evaluation\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"评估 LLM 在 IER（执行推理）、SR（规格推理）、DSR（动态语义推理）三个维度的代码推理能力。性能随代码复杂度（控制流、非原始类型、API 调用）显著下降。支持 VOTA 的 trace abstraction 动机——复杂 trace 超出 LLM 推理能力。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics: {}\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"CRUXEval-X: A Benchmark for Multilingual Code Reasoning, Understanding and Execution\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Ruiyang Xu et al. (HKUST)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ACL 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n        arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2408.13001\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: evaluation\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"将 CRUXEval 扩展到 19 种编程语言，19K 测试。仅在 Python 训练的模型在其他语言最高 34.4% Pass@1，揭示 cross-language generalization 的局限。对 VOTA 的 cross-model generalization 实验提供方法论参考。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          languages: 19\\\\n          cross_lang_max_pass1: \\\\\\\"34.4%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Chain of Execution Supervision Promotes General Reasoning in Large Language Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Nuo Chen, Zehua Li, Keqin Bao, Junyang Lin, Dayiheng Liu (Qwen/Alibaba, HKUST-GZ, USTC)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"NeurIPS 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n        arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2510.23629\\\\\\\"\\\\n        verified: true\\\\n        role: direct-competitor\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"提出 TracePile——2.6M Chain-of-Execution trace 样本（~19B tokens），涵盖数学/算法/竞赛代码。在 4 个 base model、20 个 benchmark 上验证 trace 监督提升推理能力，但仅评估生成任务，未涉及 verdict classification。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          dataset_size: \\\\\\\"2.6M samples\\\\\\\"\\\\n          dataset_tokens: \\\\\\\"~19B\\\\\\\"\\\\n          benchmarks_evaluated: 20\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"TRACED: Execution-aware Pre-training for Source Code\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Yangruibo Ding, Ben Steenhoek, Kexin Pei, Gail Kaiser, Wei Le, Baishakhi Ray\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ICSE 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n        arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2306.07487\\\\\\\"\\\\n        verified: true\\\\n        role: direct-competitor\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"用源码+可执行输入+execution trace 做 execution-aware 预训练（encoder-based），在执行路径预测提升 12.4%、运行时变量值预测提升 25.2%。证明 trace 有助于 encoder-based 分类任务，但仅用于预训练而非直接做 verdict classification。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          execution_path_prediction_improvement: \\\\\\\"+12.4%\\\\\\\"\\\\n          runtime_value_prediction_improvement: \\\\\\\"+25.2%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  code-verdict:\\\\n    description: \\\\\\\"LLM 判断代码 pass/fail、正确性分类、mutation testing\\\\\\\"\\\\n    papers:\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"APPT: Boosting Automated Patch Correctness Prediction via Fine-tuning Pre-trained Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"iSEngLab (Nanjing University)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"IEEE TSE 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: direct-competitor\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"BERT + LSTM + classifier 微调做 patch 正确性二分类。在 1183 个 Defects4J patches 上 accuracy 79.7%、recall 83.2%，优于 CACHE。与 VOTA 的 verdict 分类目标最接近。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          accuracy: \\\\\\\"79.7%\\\\\\\"\\\\n          recall: \\\\\\\"83.2%\\\\\\\"\\\\n          f1_improvement_from_finetuning: \\\\\\\"+10.22%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"LLM4PatchCorrect: Leveraging Large Language Model for Automatic Patch Correctness Assessment\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Xin Zhou et al. (SMU)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"IEEE TSE 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: direct-competitor\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"用 Starcoder-7B 零样本评估 patch 正确性，输入包含 bug description、execution traces、failing test cases、test coverage。无需微调即达 84.4% accuracy。使用了 execution trace 作为输入信号，与 VOTA 输入空间有重叠，但方法（zero-shot prompting vs SFT）和任务（patch correctness vs test verdict）不同。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          accuracy: \\\\\\\"84.4%\\\\\\\"\\\\n          f1: \\\\\\\"86.5%\\\\\\\"\\\\n        novelty_threat: medium\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Parameter-Efficient Fine-Tuning with Attributed Patch Semantic Graph for Automated Patch Correctness Assessment\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Zhenyu Yang, Jingwen Wu, Zhen Yang, Zhongxing Yu\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2505.02629\\\\\\\"\\\\n        arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2505.02629\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: direct-competitor\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"提出 APSG（Attributed Patch Semantic Graph）+ Graph-LoRA，用图结构捕获 patch 语义的 data/control flow。在 patch correctness 上比 SOTA 提升 accuracy 3.1-7.5%、F1 3.0-7.1%。方法论（PEFT + 结构化代码表示做分类）与 VOTA 有相似之处，但 VOTA 用 trace signal 而非 graph。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          accuracy_improvement: \\\\\\\"+3.1-7.5%\\\\\\\"\\\\n          f1_improvement: \\\\\\\"+3.0-7.1%\\\\\\\"\\\\n        novelty_threat: medium\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Calibration and Correctness of Language Models for Code\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Claudio Spiess, David Gros, et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ICSE 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n        arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2402.02047\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: evaluation\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"代码生成模型的置信度校准普遍较差。Platt scaling 可改善但需要先验正确性数据。对 VOTA 的启示：verdict 分类需关注校准，不只是准确率。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics: {}\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Mutation-Guided LLM-based Test Generation at Meta\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Christopher Foster et al. (Meta)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"FSE 2025 (Industry)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2501.12862\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: evaluation\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"LLM equivalence detector 判断 mutant 是否等价，加简单预处理后 precision 0.95、recall 0.96。大规模部署到 10K+ 类，工程师接受率 73%。展示了 LLM 做代码正确性判断的工业可行性。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          precision: \\\\\\\"0.95\\\\\\\"\\\\n          recall: \\\\\\\"0.96\\\\\\\"\\\\n          classes_evaluated: \\\\\\\"10795\\\\\\\"\\\\n          test_acceptance_rate: \\\\\\\"73%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"FuseFL: Demystifying Faulty Code with LLM via Step-by-Step Reasoning\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Ratnadira Widyasari et al. (SMU)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"SANER 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: background\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"融合 SBFL 排名 + test execution outcomes（input、expected/actual output、errors）+ code description 做 fault localization。Top-1 localization 比 baseline 提升 32.3%，比 SBFL 提升 68.4%。test execution outcomes 作为输入信号与 VOTA 的 fault indicator signals 理念相关。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          top1_improvement_over_baseline: \\\\\\\"+32.3%\\\\\\\"\\\\n          top1_improvement_over_sbfl: \\\\\\\"+68.4%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"CRUXEval: A Benchmark for Code Reasoning, Understanding and Execution\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Alex Gu, Baptiste Rozière, Hugh James Leather, Armando Solar-Lezama, Gabriel Synnaeve, Sida Wang\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ICML 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n        arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2401.03065\\\\\\\"\\\\n        verified: true\\\\n        role: evaluation\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"800 个 Python 函数的代码推理 benchmark，包含 input prediction 和 output prediction 两个任务。GPT-4+CoT 达 75%/81% pass@1。作为 VOTA 实验的数据集来源。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          benchmark_size: 800\\\\n          gpt4_cot_input_pass1: \\\\\\\"75%\\\\\\\"\\\\n          gpt4_cot_output_pass1: \\\\\\\"81%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  trace-compression:\\\\n    description: \\\\\\\"Execution trace 的压缩、摘要、抽象方法\\\\\\\"\\\\n    papers:\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Predictive Program Slicing via Execution Knowledge-Guided Dynamic Dependence Learning\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Aashish Yadavally, Yi Li, Tien Nguyen\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"FSE 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: method-component\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"ND-Slicer 用 execution-aware 预训练学习动态依赖，无需实际执行即可预测特定输入的程序切片。Python 上 exact-match 81.31%、ROUGE-LCS 0.954。与 VOTA 的 assertion-point snapshots 思路类似——都是从完整 trace 中提取关键信息。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          exact_match: \\\\\\\"81.31%\\\\\\\"\\\\n          rouge_lcs: \\\\\\\"0.954\\\\\\\"\\\\n          fault_localization_accuracy: \\\\\\\"63.88%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Towards Effectively Leveraging Execution Traces for Program Repair with Code LLMs\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Mirazul Haque, Petr Babkin, et al. (J.P. Morgan AI Research)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"KnowledgeNLP Workshop @ ACL 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n        arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2505.04441\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: background\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"直接将 execution trace 加入 prompt 帮助有限，且随 trace 复杂度增加效果递减。LLM 优化的 prompt 格式比原始 trace 更一致地优于无 trace baseline。直接支持 VOTA 的核心假设：原始 trace 太冗长，需要专门的压缩/抽象。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics: {}\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Making LLMs Program Interpreters via Execution Trace Chain of Thought (ET-CoT)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Koshi Eguchi, Takuya Akiba\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ICML 2025 Workshop PRAL\\\\\\\"\\\\n        openreview_id: \\\\\\\"pFyBdPyOCQ\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: method-component\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"开发 PyTracify 工具生成 sub-line 粒度的结构化 execution trace，SFT 后 Qwen2.5-7B 在 CRUXEval-O 达 70.0%、LiveCodeBench 达 88.3%，超过同规模 code-oriented 模型。其 trace 格式本身是一种 trace abstraction。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          cruxeval_o: \\\\\\\"70.0%\\\\\\\"\\\\n          livecodebench_execution: \\\\\\\"88.3%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"TraceCoder: A Trace-Driven Multi-Agent Framework for Automated Debugging of LLM-Generated Code\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Jiangping Huang, Wenguang Ye, Weisong Sun, Jian Zhang, Mingyue Zhang, Yang Liu\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2026\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ICSE 2026\\\\\\\"\\\\n        arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2602.06875\\\\\\\"\\\\n        verified: true\\\\n        role: background\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"在特定位置插入 diagnostic probes 而非全量 trace 记录，Pass@1 提升 34.43%。选择性 trace 采集优于全量，支持 VOTA 的行为模式抽象思路。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          pass_at_1_improvement: \\\\\\\"+34.43%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Runtime Execution Traces Guided Automated Program Repair with Multi-Agent Debate\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Jiaqing Wu, Tong Wu, Manqing Zhang, Yunwei Dong, Bo Shen\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2026\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2604.02647\\\\\\\"\\\\n        arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2604.02647\\\\\\\"\\\\n        verified: true\\\\n        role: background\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"Probe agent 选择性捕获 critical variables 的 execution snapshots 用于 multi-agent repair debate，修复 392 个缺陷。验证了选择性 trace 信息优于全量记录。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          defects_fixed: \\\\\\\"392\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"InspectCoder: Dynamic Analysis-Enabled Self Repair through Interactive LLM-Debugger Collaboration\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Yunkun Wang, Yue Zhang, Guochang Li, Chen Zhi, Binhua Li, Fei Huang, Yongbin Li, Shuiguang Deng\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2510.18327\\\\\\\"\\\\n        arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2510.18327\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: background\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"首个让 LLM 主动控制 debugger 做动态分析的 agentic repair 系统。Program Inspector 做策略性 breakpoint 放置和 runtime state 检查，Patch Coder 合成修复。比最强 baseline 提升 5.10-60.37%。选择性 runtime 检查理念与 VOTA 的 fault indicator signal 提取一致。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          repair_accuracy_improvement: \\\\\\\"+5.10-60.37%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"MGDebugger: From Code to Correctness via Hierarchical Debugging\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Yuling Shi et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2410.01215\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: background\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"层次化分解代码为子函数树，LLM 模拟执行追踪关键变量状态，bottom-up 定位修复。HumanEval accuracy 75.6%→94.5%。其 LLM-simulated executor 追踪变量状态的方式是一种隐式 trace abstraction。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          humaneval_accuracy: \\\\\\\"94.5%\\\\\\\"\\\\n          humaneval_fix_accuracy: \\\\\\\"97.6%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  debugging-agents:\\\\n    description: \\\\\\\"LLM 多智能体调试框架\\\\\\\"\\\\n    papers:\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"UniDebugger: Hierarchical Multi-Agent Framework for Unified Software Debugging\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Cheryl Lee, Chunqiu Steven Xia, et al. (Lingming Zhang group)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"EMNLP 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n        arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2404.17153\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: background\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"三层认知架构模拟开发者调试过程，L1→L2→L3 逐层升级。在 Defects4J 上修复 1.25-2.56x bugs。不使用 execution trace 作为输入（纯静态分析），与 VOTA 方法正交。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          defects4j_improvement: \\\\\\\"1.25-2.56x\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Seeker: Enhancing Exception Handling in Code with LLM-based Multi-Agent Approach\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Xuanming Zhang, Yuxuan Chen, Yuan Yuan, Minlie Huang\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ICLR 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n        arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2410.06949\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: background\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"5-agent 框架做 exception handling 生成，构建 Common Exception Enumeration (CEE) 知识库。Exception handling precision 提升 37%。从 exception taxonomy 角度提供背景——exception 类型和处理策略的系统化，与 VOTA 的 exception event 信号提取视角互补。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          exception_handling_precision_improvement: \\\\\\\"+37%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  sft-classification:\\\\n    description: \\\\\\\"用 SFT 做分类任务的方法论和 findings\\\\\\\"\\\\n    papers:\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Fine-Tuning Causal LLMs for Text Classification: Embedding-Based vs. Instruction-Based Approaches\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Amirhossein Yousefiramandi, Ciaran Cooney\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2512.12677\\\\\\\"\\\\n        arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2512.12677\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: method-component\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"对比 embedding-based（加分类头）vs instruction-based（prompt->response）两种 SFT 分类方式。Embedding-based + QLoRA 在 F1 上与 instruction-tuned 持平，但可训练参数少得多。对 VOTA 的 verdict 分类有直接参考价值——选哪种 SFT 格式。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics: {}\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"FisherSFT: Data-Efficient Supervised Fine-Tuning of Language Models Using Information Gain\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Rohan Deb, Kiran Koshy Thekumparampil, Kousha Kalantari, Gaurush Hiranandani, Shoham Sabach, Branislav Kveton\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ICML 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n        arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2505.14826\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: background\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"用 Fisher 信息矩阵选择信息量最大的训练样本子集，通过 last-layer 线性化高效近似。在固定数据预算下提升 SFT 效果。对 VOTA 的数据选择策略有参考价值。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics: {}\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Fine-Tuned 'Small' LLMs (Still) Significantly Outperform Zero-Shot Generative AI Models in Text Classification\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Martin Juan Jose Bucher, Marco Martini\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2406.08660\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: background\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"跨多种分类任务（情感、立场、情绪等），fine-tuned 小模型全面优于 GPT-4/Claude 的 zero-shot。验证了 VOTA 用 SFT 做 verdict 分类的基本假设——fine-tuning 在分类上优于 prompting。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics: {}\\\\n\\\\n  cross-model-generalization:\\\\n    description: \\\\\\\"跨模型 SFT 泛化：不同 base model 上 SFT 效果的迁移与差异\\\\\\\"\\\\n    papers:\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Unveiling the Generalization Power of Fine-Tuned Large Language Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Haoran Yang, Yumeng Zhang, Jiaqi Xu, Hongyuan Lu, Pheng Ann Heng, Wai Lam\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"NAACL 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n        arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2403.09162\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: method-component\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"SFT 后分类任务跨域正迁移，生成任务跨域负迁移。对 VOTA 的跨模型实验设计有直接参考——verdict 分类属于分类任务，预期正迁移。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics: {}\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"How Abilities in Large Language Models are Affected by Supervised Fine-tuning Data Composition\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Guanting Dong, Hongyi Yuan, Keming Lu, et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ACL 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n        arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2310.05492\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: method-component\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"更大/更强 base model 在相同 SFT 数据量下性能更优。DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B 预训练 2T tokens，Qwen 5.5T，比例 2.75x。对 VOTA 跨模型对比（DeepSeek vs Qwen）提供预训练数据量的基准参考。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          deepseek_coder_pretrain_tokens: \\\\\\\"2T\\\\\\\"\\\\n          qwen_pretrain_tokens: \\\\\\\"5.5T\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Analyzing the Effects of Supervised Fine-Tuning on Model Knowledge from Token and Parameter Levels\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Junjie Ye, Yuming Yang, Yang Nan, Shuo Li, Qi Zhang, Tao Gui, Xuanjing Huang, Peng Wang, Zhongchao Shi, Jianping Fan\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"EMNLP 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n        arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2509.16596\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: background\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"SFT 中 90% 参数更新不贡献知识增强；知识掌握水平不同的训练数据导致 >12% 性能波动。对 VOTA 的数据质量控制有参考意义。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          non_contributing_param_ratio: \\\\\\\"90%\\\\\\\"\\\\n          performance_variation_from_data_quality: \\\\\\\">12%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"From Code to Prediction: Fine-Tuning LLMs for Neural Network Performance Classification in NNGPT\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Mahmoud Hanouneh, Radu Timofte, Dmitry Ignatov\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2605.03686\\\\\\\"\\\\n        arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2605.03686\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: background\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"DeepSeek-Coder-7B-Instruct LoRA 微调做代码分类 80% accuracy。验证 DeepSeek-Coder 系列在代码分类 SFT 上的可行性。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          code_classification_accuracy: \\\\\\\"80%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Qwen2.5-Coder Technical Report\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Binyuan Hui, Jian Yang, et al. (Qwen Team)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2409.12186\\\\\\\"\\\\n        arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2409.12186\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: background\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"Qwen2.5-Coder 5.5T tokens 预训练，HumanEval 92.7%。作为 VOTA 跨模型实验的 base model 之一，提供预训练规模和代码能力基准。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          pretrain_tokens: \\\\\\\"5.5T\\\\\\\"\\\\n          humaneval_pass1: \\\\\\\"92.7%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nmeta:\\\\n  last_updated: \\\\\\\"2026-05-15\\\\\\\"\\\\n  total_papers: 34\\\\n  search_scope: \\\\\\\"2024-2026, top ML/NLP/SE venues\\\\\\\"\\\\n  scan_date: \\\\\\\"2026-05-15\\\\\\\"\\\\n  scan_queries: 16\\\\n  key_gaps:\\\\n    - \\\\\\\"缺少直接将 execution trace 用于 binary verdict (pass/fail) 的工作——VOTA 填补此空白\\\\\\\"\\\\n    - \\\\\\\"trace compression 文献多在 distributed systems 或 formal verification 领域，code-level trace 压缩给 LLM 用的工作极少\\\\\\\"\\\\n    - \\\\\\\"SFT for classification 研究多在 NLP 文本分类，code verdict 场景的 SFT 方法论研究接近空白\\\\\\\"\\\\n    - \\\\\\\"patch correctness prediction（LLM4PatchCorrect、APSG）是最近的竞争方向，但任务定义和输入信号与 VOTA 有本质区别\\\\\\\"\\\\n    - \\\\\\\"selective trace（InspectCoder、TraceCoder）趋势明显，但均用于 program repair 而非 verdict classification\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 18596, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01VHy7McLC726H2YkX7Buc3b","session_id":"dcb29bac-0892-40d8-9a83-9cc5c54535a5","uuid":"68c053af-814e-49d6-91ad-59cf01c905ba","timestamp":"2026-05-18T12:24:31.202Z"}
